{
  "component": "p05",
  "pages": [
    {
      "text": "TONIGHT, THE FULL PENNANT SOUND EXPERIENCE.",
      "record_id": "P05.SCENE.001",
      "resource": 205,
      "entry": 1,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "milo",
      "speaker_number": 5,
      "voice_index": 1,
      "audio_module": 915
    },
    {
      "text": "MILO PENNANT PRESENTS TOMORROW, SLIGHTLY AHEAD OF\nSCHEDULE.",
      "record_id": "P05.SCENE.001",
      "resource": 205,
      "entry": 3,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "milo",
      "speaker_number": 5,
      "voice_index": 2,
      "audio_module": 915
    },
    {
      "text": "DOES IT PLAY ANYTHING WITHOUT YOU IN IT?",
      "record_id": "P05.SCENE.001",
      "resource": 205,
      "entry": 5,
      "header_entry": 4,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 3,
      "audio_module": 915
    },
    {
      "text": "IT CAN.",
      "record_id": "P05.SCENE.001",
      "resource": 205,
      "entry": 6,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "milo",
      "speaker_number": 5,
      "voice_index": 4,
      "audio_module": 915
    },
    {
      "text": "HAVE YOU TRIED?",
      "record_id": "P05.SCENE.001",
      "resource": 205,
      "entry": 7,
      "header_entry": 4,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 5,
      "audio_module": 915
    },
    {
      "text": "I DON'T SEE WHY YOU'RE MAKING THAT SOUND LIKE A\nFEATURE.",
      "record_id": "P05.SCENE.001",
      "resource": 205,
      "entry": 8,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "milo",
      "speaker_number": 5,
      "voice_index": 6,
      "audio_module": 915
    },
    {
      "text": "PA KIT",
      "record_id": "P05.LABEL.001",
      "resource": 205,
      "entry": 10,
      "header_entry": 9,
      "speaker_id": "text",
      "speaker_number": 0,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "ALL THE EQUIPMENT FOR BEING HEARD. MILO IS\nRELUCTANT TO LEAVE THAT TO THE EQUIPMENT.",
      "record_id": "P05.LOOK.001",
      "resource": 205,
      "entry": 11,
      "header_entry": 4,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 7,
      "audio_module": 915
    },
    {
      "text": "INPUT SELECTOR",
      "record_id": "P05.LABEL.002",
      "resource": 205,
      "entry": 12,
      "header_entry": 9,
      "speaker_id": "text",
      "speaker_number": 0,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "TWO BIG SETTINGS: TAPE PLAYS MILO'S RECORDING; MIC\nLETS SOMEBODY ELSE SPEAK. YOU CAN SEE WHY HE\nPREFERS TAPE.",
      "record_id": "P05.LOOK.002",
      "resource": 205,
      "entry": 13,
      "header_entry": 4,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 8,
      "audio_module": 915
    },
    {
      "text": "TAPE [TAPE ICON]\nMIC [MICROPHONE ICON]",
      "record_id": "P05.READ.001",
      "resource": 205,
      "entry": 15,
      "header_entry": 14,
      "speaker_id": "text",
      "speaker_number": 0,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "MICROPHONE",
      "record_id": "P05.LABEL.003",
      "resource": 205,
      "entry": 16,
      "header_entry": 9,
      "speaker_id": "text",
      "speaker_number": 0,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "THE MICROPHONE HAS A CABLE WITH THREE DOTS ON THE\nPLUG. THERE'S A SOCKET HERE WITH THE SAME THREE\nDOTS.",
      "record_id": "P05.LOOK.003",
      "resource": 205,
      "entry": 17,
      "header_entry": 4,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 9,
      "audio_module": 915
    },
    {
      "text": "MIC SOCKET",
      "record_id": "P05.LABEL.004",
      "resource": 205,
      "entry": 18,
      "header_entry": 9,
      "speaker_id": "text",
      "speaker_number": 0,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "MIC. THREE DOTS, LIKE THE MICROPHONE PLUG. THEY\nMATCH WITHOUT MILO HAVING TO INTRODUCE THEM.",
      "record_id": "P05.LOOK.004",
      "resource": 205,
      "entry": 19,
      "header_entry": 4,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 10,
      "audio_module": 915
    },
    {
      "text": "MIC\n. . .",
      "record_id": "P05.READ.002",
      "resource": 205,
      "entry": 21,
      "header_entry": 20,
      "speaker_id": "text",
      "speaker_number": 0,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "LOUDSPEAKER",
      "record_id": "P05.LABEL.005",
      "resource": 205,
      "entry": 22,
      "header_entry": 9,
      "speaker_id": "text",
      "speaker_number": 0,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "THE FRONT GRILLE SENDS THE SOUND TOWARD WHOEVER IT\nFACES. EXCELLENT EQUIPMENT, ONCE WE POINT IT AT\nOUR ACTUAL LISTENER.",
      "record_id": "P05.LOOK.005",
      "resource": 205,
      "entry": 23,
      "header_entry": 4,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 11,
      "audio_module": 915
    },
    {
      "text": "SPEAKER SWIVEL HANDLE",
      "record_id": "P05.LABEL.006",
      "resource": 205,
      "entry": 24,
      "header_entry": 9,
      "speaker_id": "text",
      "speaker_number": 0,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "THE SWIVEL HANDLE TURNS THE SPEAKER TOWARD THE\nLISTENING MARK. UNLIKE MILO, IT CAN BE REDIRECTED\nBY HAND.",
      "record_id": "P05.LOOK.006",
      "resource": 205,
      "entry": 25,
      "header_entry": 4,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 12,
      "audio_module": 915
    },
    {
      "text": "MARKED LISTENING POSITION",
      "record_id": "P05.LABEL.007",
      "resource": 205,
      "entry": 26,
      "header_entry": 9,
      "speaker_id": "text",
      "speaker_number": 0,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "THE PLACE TO STAND FOR THE TEST. THE SPEAKER'S\nFRONT GRILLE NEEDS TO FACE WHOEVER STANDS HERE.",
      "record_id": "P05.LOOK.007",
      "resource": 205,
      "entry": 27,
      "header_entry": 4,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 13,
      "audio_module": 915
    },
    {
      "text": "MILO'S SLOGAN TAPE",
      "record_id": "P05.LABEL.008",
      "resource": 205,
      "entry": 28,
      "header_entry": 9,
      "speaker_id": "text",
      "speaker_number": 0,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "MILO SAYING HIS OWN NAME ON A LOOP. AN ENTIRE\nSECOND MAN, AND NEITHER OF THEM LISTENS.",
      "record_id": "P05.LOOK.008",
      "resource": 205,
      "entry": 29,
      "header_entry": 4,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 14,
      "audio_module": 915
    },
    {
      "text": "MILO PENNANT PRESENTS TOMORROW, SLIGHTLY AHEAD OF\nSCHEDULE.",
      "record_id": "P05.DIALOGUE.001",
      "resource": 205,
      "entry": 3,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "milo",
      "speaker_number": 5,
      "voice_index": 15,
      "audio_module": 915
    },
    {
      "text": "EQUIPMENT CREDIT SLATE",
      "record_id": "P05.LABEL.009",
      "resource": 205,
      "entry": 30,
      "header_entry": 9,
      "speaker_id": "text",
      "speaker_number": 0,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "AN EQUIPMENT CREDIT SLATE. THERE'S ROOM TO\nDESCRIBE MILO'S ACTUAL LOAN, EVEN WITH HIS NAME ON\nIT.",
      "record_id": "P05.LOOK.009",
      "resource": 205,
      "entry": 31,
      "header_entry": 4,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 16,
      "audio_module": 915
    },
    {
      "text": "HANDCART",
      "record_id": "P05.LABEL.010",
      "resource": 205,
      "entry": 32,
      "header_entry": 9,
      "speaker_id": "text",
      "speaker_number": 0,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "THE HANDCART COMES WITH THE LOAN AND STAYS\nAVAILABLE AFTER THE PA MOVES. TWO WHEELS, NO\nOPENING REMARKS.",
      "record_id": "P05.LOOK.010",
      "resource": 205,
      "entry": 33,
      "header_entry": 4,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 17,
      "audio_module": 915
    },
    {
      "text": "THREE DOTS TO THREE DOTS. THE MICROPHONE IS\nCONNECTED.",
      "record_id": "P05.SUCCESS.001",
      "resource": 205,
      "entry": 34,
      "header_entry": 4,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 18,
      "audio_module": 915
    },
    {
      "text": "MIC SELECTED. MILO WILL HAVE TO SAY HIS OWN NAME\nIN PERSON.",
      "record_id": "P05.SUCCESS.002",
      "resource": 205,
      "entry": 35,
      "header_entry": 4,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 19,
      "audio_module": 915
    },
    {
      "text": "THE GRILLE FACES THE LISTENING MARK NOW.",
      "record_id": "P05.SUCCESS.003",
      "resource": 205,
      "entry": 36,
      "header_entry": 4,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 20,
      "audio_module": 915
    },
    {
      "text": "WILL YOU STAND ON THE LISTENING MARK AND TELL US\nWHETHER THE WORDS ARE CLEAR?",
      "record_id": "P05.CHOICE.001",
      "resource": 205,
      "entry": 37,
      "header_entry": 4,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "YES. I'LL STAND ON THE LISTENING MARK AND LISTEN\nFOR EVERY WORD.",
      "record_id": "P05.DIALOGUE.002",
      "resource": 205,
      "entry": 39,
      "header_entry": 38,
      "speaker_id": "bunny",
      "speaker_number": 2,
      "voice_index": 21,
      "audio_module": 915
    },
    {
      "text": "JUST ONE COMPLETE SENTENCE.",
      "record_id": "P05.DIALOGUE.002",
      "resource": 205,
      "entry": 40,
      "header_entry": 4,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 22,
      "audio_module": 915
    },
    {
      "text": "GOOD. I'M NOT REVIEWING THE WHOLE OF TOMORROW.",
      "record_id": "P05.DIALOGUE.002",
      "resource": 205,
      "entry": 41,
      "header_entry": 38,
      "speaker_id": "bunny",
      "speaker_number": 2,
      "voice_index": 23,
      "audio_module": 915
    },
    {
      "text": "COULD YOU LISTEN FROM YOUR MARKED POSITION WHILE I\nTEST THE MICROPHONE?",
      "record_id": "P05.CHOICE.002",
      "resource": 205,
      "entry": 42,
      "header_entry": 4,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "READY.",
      "record_id": "P05.DIALOGUE.003",
      "resource": 205,
      "entry": 44,
      "header_entry": 43,
      "speaker_id": "audience",
      "speaker_number": 0,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "I'LL GO BACK TO THE MICROPHONE. TELL ME IF THE\nWHOLE SENTENCE COMES THROUGH.",
      "record_id": "P05.DIALOGUE.003",
      "resource": 205,
      "entry": 45,
      "header_entry": 4,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 24,
      "audio_module": 915
    },
    {
      "text": "TONIGHT, EIGHT OF US ARE HAVING SUPPER IN THE\nCOURTYARD.",
      "record_id": "P05.CHOICE.003",
      "resource": 205,
      "entry": 46,
      "header_entry": 4,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "TONIGHT, EIGHT OF US ARE HAVING SUPPER IN THE\nCOURTYARD.",
      "record_id": "P05.DIALOGUE.004",
      "resource": 205,
      "entry": 46,
      "header_entry": 4,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 25,
      "audio_module": 915
    },
    {
      "text": "EVERY WORD WAS CLEAR. EIGHT PEOPLE, SUPPER,\nCOURTYARD.",
      "record_id": "P05.SUCCESS.004",
      "resource": 205,
      "entry": 47,
      "header_entry": 38,
      "speaker_id": "bunny",
      "speaker_number": 2,
      "voice_index": 26,
      "audio_module": 915
    },
    {
      "text": "CLEAR, BALANCED, INTIMATE.",
      "record_id": "P05.SUCCESS.004",
      "resource": 205,
      "entry": 48,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "milo",
      "speaker_number": 5,
      "voice_index": 27,
      "audio_module": 915
    },
    {
      "text": "YES, MILO. IT EVEN WORKS WHEN YOU AREN'T TALKING.",
      "record_id": "P05.SUCCESS.004",
      "resource": 205,
      "entry": 49,
      "header_entry": 38,
      "speaker_id": "bunny",
      "speaker_number": 2,
      "voice_index": 28,
      "audio_module": 915
    },
    {
      "text": "EVERY WORD WAS CLEAR.",
      "record_id": "P05.SUCCESS.005",
      "resource": 205,
      "entry": 50,
      "header_entry": 43,
      "speaker_id": "audience",
      "speaker_number": 0,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "CLEAR: EVERY WORD WAS CLEAR.",
      "record_id": "P05.SYSTEM.001",
      "resource": 205,
      "entry": 52,
      "header_entry": 51,
      "speaker_id": "text",
      "speaker_number": 0,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "THAT SOCKET DOESN'T FIT. THE MICROPHONE PLUG HAS\nTHREE DOTS; THE MIC SOCKET HAS THE SAME THREE\nDOTS. I'LL MATCH THEM RATHER THAN TRY TO ENLARGE",
      "record_id": "P05.FAILURE.001",
      "resource": 205,
      "entry": 53,
      "header_entry": 4,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 29,
      "audio_module": 915
    },
    {
      "text": "MILO'S EQUIPMENT.",
      "record_id": "P05.FAILURE.001",
      "resource": 205,
      "entry": 54,
      "header_entry": 4,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 30,
      "audio_module": 915
    },
    {
      "text": "I CAN HEAR A VOICE, BUT NO CLEAR WORDS. THE GRILLE\nPOINTS AWAY FROM ME.",
      "record_id": "P05.FAILURE.002",
      "resource": 205,
      "entry": 55,
      "header_entry": 38,
      "speaker_id": "bunny",
      "speaker_number": 2,
      "voice_index": 31,
      "audio_module": 915
    },
    {
      "text": "I'LL TURN IT TOWARD YOUR LISTENING MARK.",
      "record_id": "P05.FAILURE.002",
      "resource": 205,
      "entry": 56,
      "header_entry": 4,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 32,
      "audio_module": 915
    },
    {
      "text": "YES. I'D LIKE TO BE IGNORED FACE-TO-FACE.",
      "record_id": "P05.FAILURE.002",
      "resource": 205,
      "entry": 57,
      "header_entry": 38,
      "speaker_id": "bunny",
      "speaker_number": 2,
      "voice_index": 33,
      "audio_module": 915
    },
    {
      "text": "WE CAN HEAR SOUND, BUT NOT CLEAR WORDS. TURN THE\nFRONT GRILLE TOWARD OUR LISTENING MARK.",
      "record_id": "P05.FAILURE.003",
      "resource": 205,
      "entry": 58,
      "header_entry": 43,
      "speaker_id": "audience",
      "speaker_number": 0,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "UNCLEAR: TURN THE FRONT GRILLE TOWARD OUR\nLISTENING MARK.",
      "record_id": "P05.SYSTEM.002",
      "resource": 205,
      "entry": 59,
      "header_entry": 51,
      "speaker_id": "text",
      "speaker_number": 0,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "SOUND EQUIPMENT COURTESY OF MILO PENNANT",
      "record_id": "P05.CHOICE.004",
      "resource": 205,
      "entry": 60,
      "header_entry": 4,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "SOUND EQUIPMENT COURTESY OF MILO PENNANT",
      "record_id": "P05.READ.003",
      "resource": 205,
      "entry": 60,
      "header_entry": 61,
      "speaker_id": "text",
      "speaker_number": 0,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "\"SOUND EQUIPMENT COURTESY OF MILO PENNANT.\" NOT \"A\nMILO PENNANT EVENING\"?",
      "record_id": "P05.DIALOGUE.005",
      "resource": 205,
      "entry": 62,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "milo",
      "speaker_number": 5,
      "voice_index": 34,
      "audio_module": 915
    },
    {
      "text": "THE EQUIPMENT, MILO. IT WORKS. PEOPLE CAN HEAR IT.",
      "record_id": "P05.DIALOGUE.005",
      "resource": 205,
      "entry": 63,
      "header_entry": 4,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 35,
      "audio_module": 915
    },
    {
      "text": "VERY WELL. LEAVE MY NAME A DECENT SIZE.",
      "record_id": "P05.DIALOGUE.005",
      "resource": 205,
      "entry": 64,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "milo",
      "speaker_number": 5,
      "voice_index": 36,
      "audio_module": 915
    },
    {
      "text": "A MAN OF YOUR STANDING MUST HAVE WONDERFUL SOUND.",
      "record_id": "P05.FAILURE.004",
      "resource": 205,
      "entry": 65,
      "header_entry": 4,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 37,
      "audio_module": 915
    },
    {
      "text": "SAY THE FIRST BIT AGAIN.",
      "record_id": "P05.FAILURE.004",
      "resource": 205,
      "entry": 66,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "milo",
      "speaker_number": 5,
      "voice_index": 38,
      "audio_module": 915
    },
    {
      "text": "WE STILL NEED TO TEST IT.",
      "record_id": "P05.FAILURE.004",
      "resource": 205,
      "entry": 67,
      "header_entry": 4,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 39,
      "audio_module": 915
    },
    {
      "text": "OF COURSE. I JUST WANTED TO HEAR IT ONCE BEFORE WE\nFOUND OUT WHETHER THE MICROPHONE WORKS.",
      "record_id": "P05.FAILURE.004",
      "resource": 205,
      "entry": 68,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "milo",
      "speaker_number": 5,
      "voice_index": 40,
      "audio_module": 915
    },
    {
      "text": "WILL YOU GREET PEOPLE FOR OUR SUPPER? EIGHT\nCONTRIBUTORS, FOOD, AND A CONVERSATION ABOUT\nPOSSIBLE FUTURE WORK. NO PARTNERSHIP PROMISES",
      "record_id": "P05.DIALOGUE.006",
      "resource": 205,
      "entry": 69,
      "header_entry": 4,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 41,
      "audio_module": 915
    },
    {
      "text": "TONIGHT.",
      "record_id": "P05.DIALOGUE.006",
      "resource": 205,
      "entry": 70,
      "header_entry": 4,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 42,
      "audio_module": 915
    },
    {
      "text": "NO GRAND LAUNCH?",
      "record_id": "P05.DIALOGUE.006",
      "resource": 205,
      "entry": 71,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "milo",
      "speaker_number": 5,
      "voice_index": 43,
      "audio_module": 915
    },
    {
      "text": "SUPPER.",
      "record_id": "P05.DIALOGUE.006",
      "resource": 205,
      "entry": 72,
      "header_entry": 4,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 44,
      "audio_module": 915
    },
    {
      "text": "CAN I AT LEAST ANNOUNCE THE OPENING?",
      "record_id": "P05.DIALOGUE.006",
      "resource": 205,
      "entry": 73,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "milo",
      "speaker_number": 5,
      "voice_index": 45,
      "audio_module": 915
    },
    {
      "text": "THE FRONT DOOR.",
      "record_id": "P05.DIALOGUE.006",
      "resource": 205,
      "entry": 74,
      "header_entry": 4,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 46,
      "audio_module": 915
    },
    {
      "text": "I CAN MAKE PEOPLE FEEL WANTED.",
      "record_id": "P05.DIALOGUE.006",
      "resource": 205,
      "entry": 75,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "milo",
      "speaker_number": 5,
      "voice_index": 47,
      "audio_module": 915
    },
    {
      "text": "I KNOW.",
      "record_id": "P05.DIALOGUE.006",
      "resource": 205,
      "entry": 76,
      "header_entry": 4,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 48,
      "audio_module": 915
    },
    {
      "text": "ALL RIGHT. I WANT THIS ONE TO WORK.",
      "record_id": "P05.DIALOGUE.006",
      "resource": 205,
      "entry": 77,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "milo",
      "speaker_number": 5,
      "voice_index": 49,
      "audio_module": 915
    },
    {
      "text": "THE PA AND THE HANDCART ARE YOURS TO USE.",
      "record_id": "P05.DIALOGUE.007",
      "resource": 205,
      "entry": 78,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "milo",
      "speaker_number": 5,
      "voice_index": 50,
      "audio_module": 915
    },
    {
      "text": "THANK YOU. LET'S MOVE THE PA TO THE COURTYARD.",
      "record_id": "P05.DIALOGUE.007",
      "resource": 205,
      "entry": 79,
      "header_entry": 4,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 51,
      "audio_module": 915
    },
    {
      "text": "I'LL LEAVE THE HANDCART AVAILABLE HERE. A\nSURPRISINGLY VERSATILE PART OF THE PACKAGE.",
      "record_id": "P05.DIALOGUE.007",
      "resource": 205,
      "entry": 80,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "milo",
      "speaker_number": 5,
      "voice_index": 52,
      "audio_module": 915
    },
    {
      "text": "SOUND CHECKED. MILO'S GREETER ROLE AGREED. PA\nMOVED TO THE COURTYARD; HANDCART AVAILABLE IN THE\nGARAGE.",
      "record_id": "P05.SUCCESS.006",
      "resource": 205,
      "entry": 82,
      "header_entry": 81,
      "speaker_id": "text",
      "speaker_number": 0,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "CHECK WHICH SOURCE IS PLAYING, THEN CHECK WHERE\nTHE SPEAKER IS SENDING IT.",
      "record_id": "P05.HINT.1",
      "resource": 205,
      "entry": 84,
      "header_entry": 83,
      "speaker_id": "text",
      "speaker_number": 0,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "TAPE PLAYS THE RECORDING; MIC USES THE MICROPHONE.\nMATCH THE THREE-DOT PLUG TO THE MIC SOCKET, AND\nTURN THE FRONT GRILLE TOWARD THE LISTENER.",
      "record_id": "P05.HINT.2",
      "resource": 205,
      "entry": 85,
      "header_entry": 83,
      "speaker_id": "text",
      "speaker_number": 0,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "CONNECT THE MICROPHONE TO THE MATCHING MIC SOCKET,\nSELECT MIC, AND TURN THE GRILLE TOWARD BUNNY OR\nTHE INVITED AUDIENCE. TEST A FULL SENTENCE, THEN",
      "record_id": "P05.HINT.3",
      "resource": 205,
      "entry": 86,
      "header_entry": 83,
      "speaker_id": "text",
      "speaker_number": 0,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "CREDIT MILO'S EQUIPMENT AND AGREE HIS GREETER\nROLE.",
      "record_id": "P05.HINT.3",
      "resource": 205,
      "entry": 87,
      "header_entry": 83,
      "speaker_id": "text",
      "speaker_number": 0,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "LET'S SETTLE WHO GETS THE SPOKEN FLOURISH. THE\nTRUTHFUL EQUIPMENT CREDIT STAYS EXACTLY AS AGREED.",
      "record_id": "VC01.ENTRY",
      "resource": 205,
      "entry": 88,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "milo",
      "speaker_number": 5,
      "voice_index": 53,
      "audio_module": 915
    },
    {
      "text": "ONLY THE LAST WORD. THE SOUNDCHECK, LOAN AND\nGREETER JOB STAY AGREED.",
      "record_id": "VC01.ENTRY",
      "resource": 205,
      "entry": 89,
      "header_entry": 4,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 54,
      "audio_module": 915
    },
    {
      "text": "AGREED. PRACTICE FIRST, OR BEGIN WHEN YOU'RE\nREADY?",
      "record_id": "VC01.ENTRY",
      "resource": 205,
      "entry": 90,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "milo",
      "speaker_number": 5,
      "voice_index": 55,
      "audio_module": 915
    },
    {
      "text": "I YIELD. YOU GET THE CONCISE INTRODUCTION.",
      "record_id": "VC01.WIN",
      "resource": 205,
      "entry": 91,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "milo",
      "speaker_number": 5,
      "voice_index": 56,
      "audio_module": 915
    },
    {
      "text": "SOUND EQUIPMENT COURTESY OF MILO PENNANT. THANK\nYOU, MILO.",
      "record_id": "VC01.WIN",
      "resource": 205,
      "entry": 92,
      "header_entry": 4,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 57,
      "audio_module": 915
    },
    {
      "text": "I YIELD THE LAST WORD. A BRIEF, TRUTHFUL FLOURISH,\nWITH THE EXACT EQUIPMENT CREDIT.",
      "record_id": "VC01.LOSS",
      "resource": 205,
      "entry": 93,
      "header_entry": 4,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 58,
      "audio_module": 915
    },
    {
      "text": "SOUND EQUIPMENT COURTESY OF MILO PENNANT. I'M\nPLEASED TO LEND IT FOR TONIGHT'S SUPPER AND\nCOLLABORATION TRIAL.",
      "record_id": "VC01.LOSS",
      "resource": 205,
      "entry": 94,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "milo",
      "speaker_number": 5,
      "voice_index": 59,
      "audio_module": 915
    },
    {
      "text": "A REMATCH, ON THE SAME NARROW TERMS. WE CAN\nPRACTICE FIRST.",
      "record_id": "VC01.REMATCH",
      "resource": 205,
      "entry": 95,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "milo",
      "speaker_number": 5,
      "voice_index": 60,
      "audio_module": 915
    },
    {
      "text": "OHHH.",
      "record_id": "VC01.KO.OPPONENT",
      "resource": 205,
      "entry": 96,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "milo",
      "speaker_number": 5,
      "voice_index": 61,
      "audio_module": 915
    },
    {
      "text": "OHHH.",
      "record_id": "VC01.KO.JACKIE",
      "resource": 205,
      "entry": 96,
      "header_entry": 4,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 62,
      "audio_module": 915
    },
    {
      "text": "JACKIE AND HIS OPPONENT REMAIN STANDING, FACE TO\nFACE. WILLING ONLOOKERS GATHER AROUND THEM. THE\nROOM DIMS AROUND A THEATRICAL SPOTLIGHT. METERS",
      "record_id": "VC01.STAGE",
      "resource": 205,
      "entry": 98,
      "header_entry": 97,
      "speaker_id": "text",
      "speaker_number": 0,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "SHOW NAMES, NUMBERS AND COMPOSURE COLOR. A LANDED\nLINE PRODUCES A BRIEF NON-CONTACT WINCE; AT ZERO,\nSHOW KO AND THE LOSER'S SOCIAL GROAN BEFORE ANY",
      "record_id": "VC01.STAGE",
      "resource": 205,
      "entry": 99,
      "header_entry": 97,
      "speaker_id": "text",
      "speaker_number": 0,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "QUEUED AUDIENCE RESPONSE. RESTORE THE UNDERLYING\nROOM POSITIONS ON EXIT.",
      "record_id": "VC01.STAGE",
      "resource": 205,
      "entry": 100,
      "header_entry": 97,
      "speaker_id": "text",
      "speaker_number": 0,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "FINISH THE SOUNDCHECK AND AGREE THE TRUTHFUL LOAN\nAND GREETER ROLE FIRST.",
      "record_id": "VC01.NOT_READY",
      "resource": 205,
      "entry": 101,
      "header_entry": 9,
      "speaker_id": "text",
      "speaker_number": 0,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "THE SOUNDCHECK AND ROLE ARE AGREED. COMPLETE ONE\nCONTEST ATTEMPT WITH MILO TO FINISH THIS\nPREPARATION; EITHER RESULT PERMITS PRACTICAL",
      "record_id": "VC01.NEED_RESOLUTION",
      "resource": 205,
      "entry": 102,
      "header_entry": 9,
      "speaker_id": "text",
      "speaker_number": 0,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "PROGRESS.",
      "record_id": "VC01.NEED_RESOLUTION",
      "resource": 205,
      "entry": 103,
      "header_entry": 9,
      "speaker_id": "text",
      "speaker_number": 0,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    }
  ],
